title: "Exact non-scattering homogeneous dielectrics from Schiffer counterexamples"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Mansehej
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-19
abstract: >-
  A proof of noncircular homogeneous isotropic dielectric inclusions that
  are exactly non-scattering for an explicit normalized Herglotz wave in
  the two-dimensional scalar Maxwell reduction.
keywords:
  - non-scattering inclusion
  - Schiffer conjecture
  - Herglotz wave
  - computer-assisted proof
  - Lean
